    <description>When a Quote moves to Approved and Credit_Limit_Exceeded__c is TRUE, creates a Special Instruction owned by the country-specific Finance queue. Finance reviews and acknowledges via the Finance Dashboard.

#SFDC-392: Enhanced the flow so that the MRC, NRC, and Overdue Credit limit scenarios now populate the SI description based on the specific condition that triggered the SI, instead of using a common description as before.

Additionally, if multiple scenarios are true at the same time, a separate SI will be created for each scenario with its respective description.</description>
